Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:43.57,OP-Jpn-左上,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Rumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.57,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}It’s coming
